die game released on Steam in 2016.\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Draw Slasher Game Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>\r\nIn 2016, I provided the voiceover for the Draw Slasher game trailer, as well as voicing characters and creating in-game vocal sounds throughout the game.\r\n</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Voicing Draw Slasher</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nDraw Slasher is a fast-paced, action-packed indie game featuring hand-drawn animation and a distinctive visual style. Players control Hanzo, a not-so-high ninja on a mission to rescue his family from the Pirate Monkey Zombies™.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe game’s mechanics are built around drawing mouse gestures to slash, jump, dash and unleash Ninjutsu techniques, creating a frantic and highly physical gameplay experience.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nI voiced the official trailer for Draw Slasher, along with character voices and a wide range of in-game vocal sounds, a style of performance that sits firmly within my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">character voiceover</a> work.\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qiji_6gsI0A","title":"Draw Slasher Game Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/draw-slasher-game-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Draw Slasher Game Voiceover – Trailer and Character Voices","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Draw Slasher Game Voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Game Trailer and Character Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nGame trailers require a very specific style of delivery. The voice needs to match the pace and energy of gameplay while remaining clear, engaging and memorable within a short runtime.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThat balance of performance and timing is especially important in <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">character-led voiceover</a> projects, where the voice becomes part of the gameplay experience rather than simply narrating it.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nDraw Slasher was released on Steam in October 2016 and supports Windows, Mac and Linux platforms, bringing its distinctive visual style and energetic sound design to a wide audience.\r\n</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Need a Voice for a Game or Trailer?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIf you’re developing a game, trailer or interactive project and need character voices, vocal effects or narration, I’d be happy to help.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYou can get in touch directly via my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">contact page</a>.\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back 